# ==========================================================================
# NOTE: We intentionally DO NOT ignore the dataset images/labels or the
# trained .pt weights — the lab requires them in the final GitHub repo:
#   - datasets/           (>=300 images + YOLO-format labels)
#   - models/*.pt         (trained weights: best_v1.pt, best_v2.pt)
#   - results/            (charts, metrics, failure cases)
# Fine-tuned YOLO11n/s weights are ~5-20 MB, well under GitHub's 100 MB limit.
